WEBVTT

00:10.860 --> 00:11.690
Eren...

00:18.620 --> 00:21.620
Go, Eren!

00:22.860 --> 00:24.190
Fight!

00:40.540 --> 00:42.710
Huh? Mikasa...

00:43.640 --> 00:45.050
Let's head back.

00:46.410 --> 00:48.460
What am I doing here?

02:20.990 --> 02:26.000
Since That Day

02:27.530 --> 02:31.170
That day, humanity remembered...

02:35.200 --> 02:36.360
It's one of them...

02:37.390 --> 02:38.730
A Titan!

02:44.050 --> 02:46.820
the terror of being ruled by them.

02:49.520 --> 02:54.030
The humiliation of being kept in a cage.

03:04.430 --> 03:06.330
It broke...

03:07.480 --> 03:09.330
a hole in the wall...

03:14.120 --> 03:15.800
They're coming inside!

03:15.800 --> 03:18.210
The Titans are getting inside!

03:20.450 --> 03:21.650
We have to get out of here!

03:22.360 --> 03:23.090
Eren!

03:23.560 --> 03:24.850
My house is over there...

03:25.520 --> 03:26.600
My mom!

03:27.730 --> 03:28.850
Mikasa!

03:34.700 --> 03:36.820
Nothing hit my house!

03:36.820 --> 03:38.370
Once I turn that corner,

03:38.370 --> 03:40.070
my house will still be there!

03:40.370 --> 03:41.700
Welcome home.

03:41.700 --> 03:43.870
You actually worked hard for a change.

03:46.810 --> 03:48.150
I won't let you.

03:48.150 --> 03:50.660
Joining the Survey Corps? 
Don't be stupid.

03:55.910 --> 03:57.050
Mom!

03:59.040 --> 03:59.780
Eren...

03:59.780 --> 04:01.220
Mikasa, grab that side!

04:07.540 --> 04:08.950
Hurry, Mikasa!

04:08.950 --> 04:09.850
I know.

04:09.850 --> 04:13.230
Eren, take Mikasa and run!

04:13.230 --> 04:15.060
I want to run!

04:15.400 --> 04:17.560
So hurry and get out of there!

04:18.290 --> 04:19.100
Hannes!

04:21.600 --> 04:23.700
Take the children and run!

04:24.920 --> 04:27.420
Don't underestimate me, Karla.

04:27.810 --> 04:31.600
I'll defeat the Titan, and save you all!

04:32.360 --> 04:33.210
Wait!

04:33.210 --> 04:34.620
Don't try to fight it!

04:45.480 --> 04:47.320
Wait, Hannes!

04:47.320 --> 04:49.140
What are you doing?!

04:50.350 --> 04:51.640
Thank you.

04:52.260 --> 04:54.390
My mom is still back there!

04:55.140 --> 04:57.310
Eren! Mikasa!

04:58.130 --> 05:00.270
You must survive!

05:03.570 --> 05:07.070
Stop!

05:26.970 --> 05:28.590
Hey, what are you doing?

05:28.590 --> 05:30.850
The ship's full!

05:30.850 --> 05:32.250
It's leaving!

05:37.670 --> 05:38.840
You fool...

05:38.840 --> 05:40.020
Where are you aiming?

05:45.440 --> 05:46.410
The gate...

05:46.410 --> 05:47.800
It's closing!

05:47.800 --> 05:49.000
We need to retreat.

05:49.000 --> 05:50.030
We'll be left behind!

05:50.030 --> 05:51.240
Don't close it yet...

05:51.240 --> 05:52.910
Wait a little more!

05:52.910 --> 05:55.200
Many people are still in the city!

05:55.950 --> 05:57.260
Close the gate!

05:57.260 --> 05:58.500
The Titans are coming!

05:59.480 --> 06:01.240
Get that gate shut!

06:20.680 --> 06:21.650
Fire!

06:26.630 --> 06:31.620
It's coming! Run!

06:50.260 --> 06:51.460
It's over...

06:53.300 --> 06:54.560
It's over.

06:55.390 --> 06:58.980
Humanity will be devoured by Titans again.

06:59.750 --> 07:00.940
It's over.

07:02.120 --> 07:03.120
Eren...

07:03.700 --> 07:06.460
The reason you couldn't save your mother

07:07.300 --> 07:09.450
is that you lacked the strength.

07:16.110 --> 07:17.660
I'll kill them all!

07:19.370 --> 07:23.390
I'll wipe every one of them... 
off the face of this earth!

07:24.860 --> 07:28.660
The Year: 850

07:25.140 --> 07:29.010
Today, you trainee graduates will be given

07:29.010 --> 07:30.760
three choices.

07:31.470 --> 07:35.490
You can join the Garrison, 
protecting towns and reinforcing the walls.

07:35.490 --> 07:40.170
Or the Survey Corps, who risk their lives 
beyond the walls, in Titan territory.

07:40.170 --> 07:42.920
Or the Military Police, who serve the King,

07:42.920 --> 07:44.730
lead the people, and protect internal order.

07:45.790 --> 07:47.280
Now it's our turn

07:48.100 --> 07:50.130
to devour the Titans!

08:00.710 --> 08:02.250
It's been five years since then...

08:03.690 --> 08:07.290
Humanity is finally regaining its dignity.

08:09.080 --> 08:10.130
We can win!

08:12.760 --> 08:14.470
Our counterattack

08:15.960 --> 08:17.300
has only begun!

08:29.780 --> 08:30.780
So hot!

08:30.780 --> 08:32.050
Wh-What is that?

08:37.430 --> 08:38.710
That was close...

08:41.860 --> 08:44.400
The wall has been breached?

08:45.910 --> 08:47.000
Not again...

08:47.000 --> 08:49.960
The Titans will come inside the walls again!

08:50.830 --> 08:52.300
I will annihilate all of you!

08:54.050 --> 08:57.060
Annihilate all of you...

08:59.590 --> 09:01.470
Fixed cannon maintenance team 4,

09:01.470 --> 09:03.150
prepare for combat!

09:04.400 --> 09:07.100
Our target is the Colossal Titan before us!

09:07.100 --> 09:08.360
This is our chance!

09:08.660 --> 09:10.280
Don't let it get away!

09:22.470 --> 09:23.330
Too slow!

09:25.940 --> 09:27.100
You're mine!

09:36.340 --> 09:39.580
Go!

09:42.900 --> 09:44.280
I missed?

09:50.540 --> 09:51.650
No...

09:52.220 --> 09:54.750
The Colossal Titan vanished?

09:55.290 --> 09:57.200
If they make it through,

09:57.200 --> 10:02.440
we'll relive the tragedy that 
befell us five years ago!

10:02.830 --> 10:04.660
We stop the Titans here!

10:05.110 --> 10:07.790
But I do have one request.

10:10.470 --> 10:12.920
Please... Don't die.

10:20.160 --> 10:22.680
I'm not going to die.

10:23.540 --> 10:25.710
I can't die here.

10:27.210 --> 10:29.120
Team 34, advance!

10:29.120 --> 10:30.600
Support the vanguard!

10:47.700 --> 10:49.030
An Aberrant!

10:49.780 --> 10:50.670
Stop!

11:07.760 --> 11:09.590
How dare you?!

11:10.210 --> 11:10.940
Eren!

11:12.020 --> 11:13.440
Wait!

11:14.790 --> 11:16.650
I'll avenge Thomas...

11:17.230 --> 11:20.490
I won't let you get away!

11:29.340 --> 11:30.120
Eren!

11:34.460 --> 11:35.250
Why

11:35.250 --> 11:36.070
can't I

11:36.480 --> 11:37.780
move?

12:02.630 --> 12:03.570
Eren!

12:04.400 --> 12:08.540
I can't die here...

12:12.100 --> 12:14.250
Eren! Hurry!

12:44.700 --> 12:47.740
It wasn't supposed to be this way.

12:51.120 --> 12:56.200
Why do they take everything from us?

12:57.210 --> 12:58.420
Our lives.

12:58.820 --> 13:00.020
Our dreams...

13:02.050 --> 13:03.240
Why?

13:06.350 --> 13:10.430
You must master this power!

13:13.800 --> 13:15.420
I won't give up!

13:16.040 --> 13:17.560
I'll eliminate them all...

13:19.100 --> 13:22.520
I'll kill them myself!

13:59.190 --> 14:02.020
I'll wipe them off the face

14:02.820 --> 14:04.220
of the earth.

14:08.660 --> 14:10.580
Every single one!

14:11.680 --> 14:13.160
More...

14:13.160 --> 14:14.750
More...

14:15.410 --> 14:18.870
I want to kill...

14:18.870 --> 14:20.040
A Titan killing another Titan?

14:20.390 --> 14:21.620
Kill...

14:22.410 --> 14:23.710
more...

14:41.060 --> 14:43.620
Eren, don't you know who I am?

14:43.620 --> 14:44.820
It's me, Mikasa!

14:45.390 --> 14:47.900
Your family!

14:47.900 --> 14:50.660
You must use that boulder 
to seal the hole!

14:51.170 --> 14:52.710
Move, Ackerman!

15:13.800 --> 15:15.030
What?

15:16.320 --> 15:18.950
What... am I doing now?

15:19.950 --> 15:21.600
Am I sitting?

15:22.540 --> 15:24.010
I can't see a thing.

15:24.780 --> 15:26.310
What day is it?

15:28.020 --> 15:29.110
Where am I?

15:35.520 --> 15:36.620
Hmm?

15:37.760 --> 15:38.930
I'm at home?

15:46.180 --> 15:47.330
I'll go back to sleep.

15:48.660 --> 15:50.500
He will become a Titan,

15:50.500 --> 15:53.670
pick up the giant boulder 
by the shattered gate,

15:53.670 --> 15:56.880
carry it over, and seal the hole.

15:54.450 --> 15:59.190
I don't know if I can use the 
Titan's power to lift that boulder.

16:00.020 --> 16:03.020
But I understand what I must do...

16:03.810 --> 16:06.670
I must become a symbol

16:08.360 --> 16:10.850
of hope for everyone!

16:12.810 --> 16:13.910
I'll do it...

16:14.430 --> 16:16.290
I'll make this happen!

16:28.500 --> 16:30.510
Armin, that's insane! Stop!

16:30.510 --> 16:33.680
Mikasa, do what you can!

16:33.680 --> 16:36.010
If you go, some lives might be saved!

16:36.230 --> 16:38.510
Leave Eren to me!

16:43.990 --> 16:45.770
Eren, can you hear me?

16:46.440 --> 16:48.120
Come to your senses!

16:48.120 --> 16:50.690
If we don't get out of 
here, we'll all die!

16:51.280 --> 16:53.680
Don't let the Titan's body take over!

16:53.680 --> 16:57.700
Just come out of that 
lump of flesh, now!

16:58.140 --> 16:59.980
One 13-meter class!

16:59.980 --> 17:01.700
It's approaching Jaeger!

17:02.390 --> 17:04.960
More Titans coming through the hole!

17:05.980 --> 17:07.970
Four Titans, approximately 
10-meter class!

17:13.600 --> 17:14.970
Captain, we're finished!

17:16.540 --> 17:18.810
We're the last ones left!

17:19.360 --> 17:22.350
We should recall them 
to defend the gate.

17:22.350 --> 17:23.360
Shall I do it?

17:23.360 --> 17:24.350
No.

17:25.260 --> 17:27.330
Shouldn't we order the 
elite force to retreat?

17:27.330 --> 17:28.380
No.

17:28.380 --> 17:31.990
Continue drawing the Titans 
to the edge of town.

17:32.360 --> 17:34.940
Eren! Get out of there!

17:34.940 --> 17:36.040
Hurry!

17:36.040 --> 17:38.480
Eren! Eren!

17:41.200 --> 17:43.750
What happened to avenging your mother?

17:44.240 --> 17:46.680
Aren't you going to wipe out the Titans?

17:46.680 --> 17:50.500
Don't you hate the things 
that killed your mother?

17:51.230 --> 17:53.560
What are you talking about, Armin?

17:54.970 --> 17:57.690
Mom's right here...

17:58.510 --> 18:00.380
Eren! Eren!

18:00.380 --> 18:02.440
Wake up, Eren!

18:02.440 --> 18:04.770
You're still in there, aren't you?

18:04.770 --> 18:08.320
If we stay here, the 
Titans will kill us!

18:08.320 --> 18:10.270
Everything will end here!

18:12.150 --> 18:13.680
Like I said...

18:13.680 --> 18:16.520
I don't understand you, Armin.

18:19.190 --> 18:22.190
Why do I have to leave?

18:22.190 --> 18:23.290
Yeah...

18:24.040 --> 18:25.950
Why would I want to leave?

18:26.080 --> 18:28.040
The outside world...

18:28.480 --> 18:32.420
Wouldn't it be great if, one day, 
we could go explore the outside world, too?

18:35.150 --> 18:37.420
The outside world!

18:37.630 --> 18:40.040
I am going to exterminate all of the Titans,

18:40.040 --> 18:41.890
and escape these cramped walls!

18:41.890 --> 18:43.810
That is my dream...

18:45.220 --> 18:47.570
Eren... Answer me!

18:48.190 --> 18:52.900
You knew that hell was one 
step beyond the walls.

18:53.250 --> 18:58.090
You might die horribly, 
like my mom and dad did.

18:58.550 --> 19:02.910
So why did you want to go?

19:06.160 --> 19:07.660
Why?

19:08.990 --> 19:11.880
You know why.

19:22.010 --> 19:25.260
Because I was born into this world!

19:30.200 --> 19:31.170
Eren...

19:31.680 --> 19:32.880
Mikasa!

19:34.610 --> 19:35.610
Armin!

19:36.390 --> 19:38.270
Eren won!

19:38.270 --> 19:41.320
Now he's trying to get the job done!

19:41.760 --> 19:44.950
If we can cover him till 
he gets to the gate,

19:44.950 --> 19:46.580
we win!

19:51.870 --> 19:53.490
Defend him at all costs!

19:54.190 --> 19:58.780
Protect Eren until he reaches the gate, 
even if it costs you your life!

19:59.420 --> 20:02.300
Don't let any of the Titans near him!

20:10.100 --> 20:14.170
From the time we are born,

20:15.110 --> 20:16.110
we are free...

20:19.040 --> 20:20.780
It doesn't matter how strong

20:21.310 --> 20:24.160
those who would deny 
us that freedom are...

20:26.010 --> 20:30.830
Flaming water... Frozen earth... 
I don't care what it is!

20:31.620 --> 20:33.310
The one who sees them

20:34.070 --> 20:37.540
will be the freest person in the world!

20:39.930 --> 20:40.880
Fight...

20:41.940 --> 20:44.760
I'd willingly give my life for that!

20:46.820 --> 20:50.790
It doesn't matter how 
terrifying the world is.

20:53.470 --> 20:57.190
It doesn't matter how 
cruel the world is!

20:58.810 --> 20:59.690
Fight...

21:00.940 --> 21:01.940
Fight!

21:03.020 --> 21:04.450
Fight!

21:05.130 --> 21:06.320
Fight!

21:08.200 --> 21:11.200
Go, Eren!

21:12.370 --> 21:13.640
Fight!

21:30.410 --> 21:32.490
What am I doing here?

21:33.700 --> 21:36.220
You're so out of it. 
Were you sound asleep?

21:36.770 --> 21:37.720
No...

21:38.170 --> 21:42.880
It's just, I feel like I had a really long dream.

21:44.280 --> 21:45.860
What was it about?

21:46.370 --> 21:47.950
I can't remember...

21:52.140 --> 21:54.330
Eren, why are you crying?

22:02.500 --> 22:05.170
Answer up, you piece of crap.

22:06.040 --> 22:07.800
What do you want to do?

22:13.100 --> 22:15.130
I want to join the Survey Corps

22:15.670 --> 22:18.360
and just slaughter the Titans!

23:53.730 --> 23:56.050
The time for dreams is over.

23:56.910 --> 24:01.930
Eren wakes in the dim and damp underground jail cell,

24:01.930 --> 24:06.100
only to face a special military tribunal 
that will decide his fate.

24:05.400 --> 24:06.950
Still Can't See 
Night Before the Counteroffensive (1)
